@startuml
title Diagram 1. System context: Plant Disease AI
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction

database "Datasets (offline)\nPlantVillage, PlantDoc,\nown field photos" as D #FFFDE7
database "Knowledge sources (offline)\nextension guides, articles,\nofficial recommendations" as K #FFFDE7
actor "Team / maintainer" as T
rectangle "<b>Plant Disease AI</b>\n\nWeb application (PWA) and REST API:\ndiagnosis from a leaf photo,\nadvice with sources, history" as S #E3F2FD
actor "Registered user\n(grower, gardener,\nstudent, agronomist)" as U
cloud "Language model service\n(external API)" as L #FFFDE7

D ..> T : training and\ntest data
K ..> T : documents\nto index
T ..> S : trained model (ONNX),\nindexed knowledge base,\ndeployment

U --> S : leaf photo, language,\nlogin / registration
S --> U : diagnosis (top 3, confidence),\nheatmap, advice with sources,\nhistory
S --> L : text only: crop, disease,\nretrieved passages, language
L --> S : advice text

note bottom of S
  A visitor (not logged in) can only
  register or log in. There is no
  administrator role in this version.
end note
@enduml
